OL,3,GNEWSAParents in shock after rats and
OL,4,Agun found at nursery
OL,5,
OL,6,FParents have been left "appalled and
OL,7,Fheartbroken" after a gun was found by
OL,8,Fpolice during a raid on a day nursery
OL,9,Fin Greater Manchester.
OL,11,FThe discovery followed the sudden
OL,12,Fclosure of Mini Fingers nursery, in
OL,13,FIrlam, Salford on Monday, after council
OL,14,Finspectors discovered rats in the
OL,15,Fbuilding. In an email, the nursery
OL,16,Fmanager attributed the closure "to the
OL,17,Frecent events and the business
OL,18,Fstruggling", adding she was
OL,19,F"devastated".
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
