OL,3,GNEWSAParents in shock after rats and
OL,4,Agun found at nursery
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Wednesday, acting on intelligence,
OL,7,Fpolice raided the premises and found a
OL,8,Ffirearm, along with a "substantial
OL,9,Fquantity" of ammunition. Two men were
OL,10,Farrested on suspicion of drug offences.
OL,12,FOne parent said the incident had
OL,13,F"completely destroyed" her trust in
OL,14,Fnursery settings.
